# Test File Placement Guidelines

Test files should not be placed in the root directory
This is a Flutter monorepo using Melos for package management

Place tests in individual packages:

- flutter_blueprint/packages/app/test/      # For app tests
- flutter_blueprint/packages/core/test/     # For core tests  
- flutter_blueprint/packages/features/test/ # For feature tests
- flutter_blueprint/packages/shared/test/   # For shared tests

To run tests:

1. cd flutter_blueprint/packages/app
2. flutter test

Or use melos (if installed):

melos run test
